Manage node authentication and approval

Usage: headscale auth [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  register  Register a node to your network
  approve   Approve a pending authentication request
  reject    Reject a pending authentication request
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -c, --config <CONFIG>  config file (default is /etc/headscale/config.yaml) [env: HEADSCALE_CONFIG=]
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>  Output format. Empty for human-readable, 'json', 'json-line' or 'yaml'
      --force            Disable prompts and forces the execution
  -h, --help             Print help
